# The site image's context, in place of the root `.dockerignore`. Everything is
# out unless it is named: the site, the design language it imports, and this
# image's Caddyfile.

*
!site/
!sketches/shared/
!deploy/site/Caddyfile

# What `npm install` and `next build` write on a laptop. The image installs
# and builds its own.
site/node_modules/
site/.next/
site/out/
site/next-env.d.ts
site/*.tsbuildinfo
